<title>GERMANY: German BBDO ad unit posts 5.0 percent Q1 growth.</title>
<headline>German BBDO ad unit posts 5.0 percent Q1 growth.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German unit of advertising group BBDO said on Thursday it boosted its turnover in the first quarter of 1997 by five percent from the previous year and expected growth to keep rising this year.</p>
<p>BBDO said winning the accounts of television channels ZDF and SPD and the environmental organisation Arbeitsgemeinschaft PVC und Umwelt helped to increase volume.</p>
<p>The agency, since 1991 Germany's largest ad group, posted 1.6 billion marks in advertising volume in 1996.</p>
</text>
